WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:07.429
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Lily. Welcome to Online Class!

2
00:00:07.479 --> 00:00:10.349
Hi! I'm Malis!

3
00:00:10.399 --> 00:00:12.114
Unit seven. Huge and Little

4
00:00:12.797 --> 00:00:17.631
Let's learn eight new words. Listen, then it's your turn to say it!

5
00:00:18.631 --> 00:00:20.246
Huge!

6
00:00:20.296 --> 00:00:25.151
Huge. Your turn!

7
00:00:25.201 --> 00:00:26.135
Huge!

8
00:00:26.185 --> 00:00:27.335
Great!

9
00:00:28.119 --> 00:00:29.803
Little!

10
00:00:29.854 --> 00:00:34.871
Little. Your turn!

11
00:00:34.921 --> 00:00:35.983
Little!

12
00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:37.183
Super!

13
00:00:38.083 --> 00:00:39.744
Tall!

14
00:00:39.794 --> 00:00:44.777
Tall. Your turn!

15
00:00:44.827 --> 00:00:45.865
Tall!

16
00:00:45.915 --> 00:00:47.333
Well done!

17
00:00:48.337 --> 00:00:50.091
Short!

18
00:00:50.141 --> 00:00:54.891
Short. Your turn!

19
00:00:54.941 --> 00:00:56.074
Short!

20
00:00:56.124 --> 00:00:57.274
Yes!

21
00:00:58.288 --> 00:00:59.718
Long!

22
00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:04.623
Long. Your turn!

23
00:01:04.673 --> 00:01:05.932
Long!

24
00:01:05.982 --> 00:01:07.295
Good job!

25
00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:10.054
Fat!

26
00:01:10.104 --> 00:01:15.121
Fat. Your turn!

27
00:01:15.171 --> 00:01:16.163
Fat!

28
00:01:16.213 --> 00:01:17.675
Wonderful!

29
00:01:18.542 --> 00:01:20.041
Thin!

30
00:01:20.091 --> 00:01:24.969
Thin. Your turn!

31
00:01:25.019 --> 00:01:25.976
Thin!

32
00:01:26.026 --> 00:01:27.176
Nice!

33
00:01:28.332 --> 00:01:29.959
Tiny!

34
00:01:30.008 --> 00:01:35.037
Tiny. Your turn!

35
00:01:35.087 --> 00:01:36.184
Tiny!

36
00:01:36.234 --> 00:01:37.599
Excellent!

37
00:01:38.365 --> 00:01:46.523
Huge, Huge, Huge! Little, Little, Little! Tall, Tall, Tall! Short, Short, Short!

38
00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:54.710
Long, Long, Long! Fat, Fat, Fat! Thin, Thin, Thin! Tiny, Tiny, Tiny!

39
00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:57.948
Clap, clap! Great chanting!

40
00:01:58.722 --> 00:02:07.696
The elephant is huge, but the mouse is tiny. The giraffe is tall and the snake is long. I am little, but I am growing!

41
00:02:07.746 --> 00:02:10.407
I love this story, Ms. Lily!

42
00:02:11.445 --> 00:02:16.996
What is it? Can you say it?

43
00:02:17.046 --> 00:02:19.230
Fat! Well done!

44
00:02:20.411 --> 00:02:25.952
What is it? Can you say it?

45
00:02:26.002 --> 00:02:28.474
Little! Well done!

46
00:02:29.732 --> 00:02:35.062
What is it? Can you say it?

47
00:02:35.112 --> 00:02:37.343
Short! Well done!

48
00:02:38.598 --> 00:02:40.461
Let's say it together!

49
00:02:40.511 --> 00:02:44.264
The whale is huge. The ant is tiny.

50
00:02:44.314 --> 00:02:48.727
Your turn!

51
00:02:48.777 --> 00:02:52.193
The whale is huge. The ant is tiny.

52
00:02:53.432 --> 00:02:59.267
What is huge? What is tiny?

53
00:02:59.317 --> 00:03:01.156
The whale is huge.

54
00:03:01.206 --> 00:03:02.631
Great answer!

55
00:03:03.732 --> 00:03:09.225
Today's value is self-acceptance. Big or little, you are special.

56
00:03:09.275 --> 00:03:11.551
I will try, Ms. Lily!

57
00:03:12.324 --> 00:03:18.941
Great job today, everyone! See you in Unit eight. Bye-bye!

58
00:03:18.991 --> 00:03:20.216
Bye-bye!

